    "text:Yes! There are three flowers.": "/audio/41f6157911d3e1e51ca905e8.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Count one, two, three. There are three flowers.": "/audio/a56f2b8b93ad446ce319fcd1.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Three birds are in the tree.": "/audio/11ef45f4458c8b5aad67d0d4.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Count the birds on the branches: one, two, three.": "/audio/51e20f7a9632e71d1cb0bb4b.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Five flowers. Two plus three equals five.": "/audio/30c38f5ca9dece18c234ac5d.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Two red flowers and three yellow flowers make five altogether.": "/audio/0e0abc3565979e82c6f3195b.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Two birds are left.": "/audio/404093caa81dfbd29dbb9056.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. One bird flew away. Count the two birds still in the tree.": "/audio/eafd18feb2a93fcfbd18de13.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Each brother gets one piece. They all get the same amount.": "/audio/a673f4bad24ee5261a76003a.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Six apples. Three groups of two equals six.": "/audio/68ffe11db5c34fb96b7348db.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Look at each plate. There is one equal piece on each plate.": "/audio/875d3ff474f3f4747ddb9a12.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Count two apples in each of the three baskets. Two, four, six.": "/audio/9ec1ade7f36718c195ff6291.mp3",
    "text:Yes! A triangle has three sides.": "/audio/9a3353cf63d941ac4bfe3e69.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The blue ribbon is longer.": "/audio/1fadca9e38cad9e6e4c8e08d.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Follow the triangle’s three straight sides. A square has four. A circle has no straight sides.": "/audio/d51913a3b7f2634448207240.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Both ribbons start at the same place. The blue ribbon reaches farther.": "/audio/3a355587f55d220c9461ebf6.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The blue cup has more water.": "/audio/718389b12d160419e7407042.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The cups are the same size. The blue cup has the higher water level.": "/audio/cd648f9ede288ab72d056f0d.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Eight taka. Five plus three equals eight.": "/audio/cac806642f1e67099e498345.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Add five taka for the mango and three taka for the banana. The total is eight taka.": "/audio/95f8eaf3c042e81cbfe48e60.mp3",
    "text:Yes! It is three o’clock.": "/audio/7dcf6947b9fcdc616efcc8ff.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The bird has the most. Three is more than two.": "/audio/73bce4f6261343e1e0e27c1c.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The short hand points to three. The long hand points to twelve.": "/audio/44135eb97f13950e2f2a264d.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Count three stickers for the bird and two for the flower. The bird has more.": "/audio/c158f616643cda9cc8d06233.mp3",
    "text:Yes! One more sticker. Three minus two equals one.": "/audio/38928e71e686b0ff50b44075.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The grass in sunlight stayed green.": "/audio/fd762702adeb78598cd91ca5.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Match two stickers in each row. The bird has one extra sticker.": "/audio/1fd76ba08f7eb891c98d1721.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The Sun warms the water.": "/audio/0aa67a194aa15d038b8e9758.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The green grass had sunlight. The covered grass became pale over several days.": "/audio/6b3d98fe6911aeef77ca418d.mp3",
    "text:Yes! Rain falls from the clouds.": "/audio/ffcc8988ca17da213f431117.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the sunlight warming the river.": "/audio/a8d5d6c282037189b92087af.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The lungs help us breathe.": "/audio/620ea6d7592efb1dfdb5530a.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The tiny cloud drops join into larger drops that fall as rain.": "/audio/cbb6ea994e1a23436ad03de1.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Find the two blue lungs in the chest. They help us breathe.": "/audio/6e08b44bb7c24ffa6dd19627.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The heart pumps blood.": "/audio/c628131ff3d37e1bd9418b82.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The heart is the pump. It moves blood around the body.": "/audio/9c30c9a5a60c72d076e81368.mp3",
    "text:Yes! We hear with our ears.": "/audio/3fa1648d3ca23c81f3d3da96.mp3",
    "text:Yes! We taste with our tongue.": "/audio/53f5983098a37b7643691d34.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The tongue helps us taste the apple. The nose helps us smell.": "/audio/af4895a9c464ec83e19d8777.mp3",
    "text:Yes! We showed the frog by a pond.": "/audio/73b0d38ea35377610d1dfff3.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Remember the frog beside the water. Its home in our story is the pond.": "/audio/c289021ebac0627f977d0594.mp3",
    "text:Yes! We showed the cow on a farm.": "/audio/2f075b765e71531f1517baaa.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The bell makes a sound. Our ears help us hear it.": "/audio/22c4fafd965f6c524d55a750.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Remember the cow near the barn. We showed a farm.": "/audio/44b8a227db0b2b470f38a29b.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The place facing the Sun has daylight.": "/audio/e90fe4f78f203e15ab4ac064.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The Sun lights the side facing it. The other side is dark.": "/audio/ace15157b928c5e1ae5c43db.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The wooden block floated.": "/audio/1d521d1357aa09b0d382cb0d.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the key at the bottom of the water.": "/audio/8c9f4a2b63e9280cec872de0.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The solid steel key sank.": "/audio/baf085c38e0597d64d98e695.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The toy is pushed away.": "/audio/9ebaa309e7c26077f1571b52.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The wagon is pulled closer.": "/audio/7bf5ef3b52c3e6015b958e18.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. A push moves the toy away from the child. A pull brings the wagon closer.": "/audio/f05568224ca27fd3e733face.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The magnet pulled the steel paper clip.": "/audio/10073e61bc0281c140d6d5d2.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the rope pulling the wagon toward the child.": "/audio/1c5755301857f10f9b26cc7f.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The wooden block stayed at the water surface. The solid steel key went down.": "/audio/db5c39ddddc10c0a8ab2b36a.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. This plain steel clip is magnetic. The wood and aluminium foil did not move.": "/audio/deb509415a60abde63e88871.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The aluminium foil stayed still. Not every metal is pulled by our magnet.": "/audio/9523c879f600e1a3653fa017.mp3",
    "text:Yes! The switch turns the light on and off.": "/audio/255501238252bff954aea601.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. The foil is metal, but this ordinary magnet did not pull it.": "/audio/bbd4ff5ab7407543fa2e6394.mp3",
    "text:Thank you for trying. Look for the yellow glow from the lit lamp.": "/audio/94b1dbeddccaa842228b7c35.mp3",
    "text:Yes! This lamp is on. It gives light.": "/audio/66ed4f4e4b5ae10185564e93.mp3",
    "text:Good job!": "/audio/a54540c0206820f930ab80f6.mp3",
