    "text:We find a seat by the sea. I see a shell on the beach. Dad sits on the seat. We listen to the sea and rest.": "/audio/9adea674285e0d1f1a966230.mp3",
    "text:I paint rain on a page. I paint a cat by the rain. The cat has a long tail. Mum puts my painting on the wall.": "/audio/611971eabec45766341be765.mp3",
    "text:pick": "/audio/d46e2fe6174d3d5b47bfb1e3.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered A seat by the sea. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/3f612cc9b9d719d0c8f041e6.mp3",
