    "text:clean": "/audio/174b353313dc7399fa6d9470.mp3",
    "text:The answer is peach. Remember: We each eat a piece of the peach.": "/audio/c5a5b0d5a7c234b1a81e9570.mp3",
    "text:Where did Dad and the child put the bag?": "/audio/e6354c8e610d6e3f7425f5c4.mp3",
