    "text:You read and remembered A clean beach. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/915b2a9eafa1f6b3d86462f4.mp3",
    "text:The answer is bin. Remember: Dad and I put the bag in a bin.": "/audio/878ec12a6e69f77eda2831c5.mp3",
