    "text:Who drank the water?": "/audio/ef481c4d363378634f7610ca.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered Bismillah, then a bite. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/5cbbc83f7cf505fa2aa64cad.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered A smile for my friend. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/bcf36c4dbc66e70b2277c4f3.mp3",
    "text:Remember: The cat drinks.": "/audio/ad3bcb6701fc031c37c2d82f.mp3",
    "text:The answer is cat. Remember: The cat drinks.": "/audio/e0b7ac09588fa16dbfb51ea0.mp3",
    "text:A bun is on my plate. I reach for the bun. Mum smiles. “What do we say?” “Bismillah!” I say. I eat with my right hand.": "/audio/b17bd3c6c82879d69b9f46c5.mp3",
    "text:Who was at the door?": "/audio/1fb3d1537e7c4c727d5d9afb.mp3",
