    "text:A new boy sits by me. He looks at the floor. I smile and say, “Come and play!” He smiles at me. We play with my ball.": "/audio/627b6d8fa3bdfdbc07124710.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Dad. Remember: Dad is at the door.": "/audio/a304b2721485307e67ca0eb3.mp3",
    "text:How many dates did the child have at first?": "/audio/b55f6d94e64ab9720cb59374.mp3",
