    "text:You read and remembered Salam at the door. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/43b41218af808a48cf16ac75.mp3",
    "text:Remember: I have two dates.": "/audio/0a9e5eb7956dcbb040a84235.mp3",
    "text:What did the little brother bring?": "/audio/38ada2512c31b61bf1fa7a91.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered One date, two smiles. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/33decc2e567d0865887dfc49.mp3",
