    "text:Remember: We get a cloth and wipe it up.": "/audio/9b2bb3970e0f5e3d718b53ed.mp3",
    "text:The answer is cloth. Remember: We get a cloth and wipe it up.": "/audio/540444e8354b25ff05166690.mp3",
    "text:What did the child put neatly together?": "/audio/45e7d77f7bd85e0715f16a61.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered The red cup. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/e1597c835a30e5cb69b6ab7b.mp3",
