    "text:Remember: The bird takes a drink!": "/audio/0235665b7276f04207b318b8.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered A clear path. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/de57f99843c5f822dc93bca6.mp3",
    "text:The answer is bird. Remember: The bird takes a drink!": "/audio/a33cdf7f6fa75d77feefc797.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered The little bird. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/b455de8b369075ced8349379.mp3",
    "text:What did the child show Mum?": "/audio/58e6e184d5a2f000c326bf54.mp3",
