    "text:Remember: I show her my new drawing.": "/audio/26c77506c82aa00356609877.mp3",
    "text:We walk to the park. A big twig is on the path. “Someone may trip,” says Dad. Dad moves it aside. Now the path is clear.": "/audio/90b4368e7b6f6e7e34e06b58.mp3",
    "text:What did they build again?": "/audio/fffd3ed621da93510fbe2ab5.mp3",
    "text:The answer is drawing. Remember: I show her my new drawing.": "/audio/d4600345e70fcb723778560e.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered May I come in?. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/e57ad5686503826394f64e00.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered The fallen blocks. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/55eaf69c4b560f2ba6d77395.mp3",
    "text:Remember: I ride my red bike.": "/audio/e17582d41f0913a4db249f82.mp3",
    "text:The answer is tower. Remember: My brother builds a tall tower. I bump it with my foot. Down go the blocks! “I am sorry,” I say. We build it again—together.": "/audio/8d39a6e68ae494d2c37aeab8.mp3",
