    "text:The answer is bike. Remember: I ride my red bike.": "/audio/367ed5643a6b1fbc6afc5bed.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered My turn, your turn. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/2699b98539b91e7e07b57911.mp3",
