    "text:What did the child draw?": "/audio/82203f01b8c55a7923b23260.mp3",
    "text:You read and remembered The lost pencil. Read again whenever you like.": "/audio/aa461a805d2c37dea007a869.mp3",
    "text:Remember: I draw a flower for Grandma.": "/audio/23c390d027ba0fe600aa8174.mp3",
