    "text:The answer is Mum. Remember: I step away and call Mum.": "/audio/181b8a31b55490d7ff723110.mp3",
    "text:You counted three flowers.": "/audio/f40db54259cdfcf8e27d5021.mp3",
    "text:My brother hits my arm. “Stop. That hurts,” I say. I step away and call Mum. Mum helps us. He says, “I am sorry.” “I forgive you. Please do not hit me.”": "/audio/7da56d60b8daf4b8a08c22b7.mp3",
