    "text:The answer is Red ribbon. Start at the same line. The red ribbon reaches farther.": "/audio/f7eee14e763eb06a14cf0cc0.mp3",
    "text:Cup B has more water.": "/audio/4cfc313b978729b2b5eb4791.mp3",
    "text:You explored The Long Ribbon. Say the English sentence and show what it means.": "/audio/05f1f8df6da392e60b97535f.mp3",
    "text:You explored Fill the Cups. Say the English sentence and show what it means.": "/audio/9a750a6316496ef22d220959.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Cup B. The cups are the same size. Cup B has the higher water level.": "/audio/75612bae7ecd83fb56e3204b.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Blue cup. Thank you for trying. The cups are the same size. The blue cup has the higher water level.": "/audio/b2bf92dff37e5684a9cb07f8.mp3",
    "text:Choose the mango and banana for our basket.": "/audio/f6ea355ec3e77a947e788ca9.mp3",
    "text:Choose the price of the mango.": "/audio/55876cd9e98910c4630b52f0.mp3",
    "text:The mango and banana cost eight taka altogether.": "/audio/f18e2dd68d74a49c68457e7c.mp3",
    "text:You explored At the Little Shop. Say the English sentence and show what it means.": "/audio/87754c60bf366e9880053efd.mp3",
    "text:The cups are the same size. Cup B has the higher water level.": "/audio/6990f139fc9227383ff02864.mp3",
    "text:Set the playtime clock to three o’clock.": "/audio/b1d89974449f13944426ffbc.mp3",
    "text:A new clock. What time is it?": "/audio/6be67c8e3dcc5b8f7675861f.mp3",
    "text:It is six o’clock.": "/audio/36dd1f3b6eb646a77cd81809.mp3",
    "text:The answer is 8. Thank you for trying. Add five taka for the mango and three taka for the banana. The total is eight taka.": "/audio/80cbc09fc3baf88bbf5be0b3.mp3",
    "text:The answer is ৳5. The mango costs five taka.": "/audio/d8b3bee5ae6f28cb14522cc8.mp3",
    "text:The answer is six o’clock. It is six o’clock.": "/audio/d079a6618f826666e6777321.mp3",
    "text:Give the bird three stickers and the flower two.": "/audio/e3f76b4dcc101dcd9f70bd14.mp3",
    "text:You explored The Playtime Clock. Say the English sentence and show what it means.": "/audio/d31371ab27281d3766053b34.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Three o’clock. Thank you for trying. The short hand points to three. The long hand points to twelve.": "/audio/c25aaec41ea96ae4061dac4d.mp3",
    "text:Which row has the most stickers?": "/audio/4af056882a439100b6117817.mp3",
    "text:The bird has three stickers. The flower has two stickers.": "/audio/8d5af8bb1052a873a34e4453.mp3",
    "text:The answer is 1. Thank you for trying. Match two stickers in each row. The bird has one extra sticker.": "/audio/fa5164ccf0a44a416c140e45.mp3",
    "text:Count both rows. Three is more than two.": "/audio/bd3e8f94f709644b2371b0b6.mp3",
    "text:The flower row has three. The bird row has two.": "/audio/f55493c637fff962a06e75be.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Bird. Thank you for trying. Count three stickers for the bird and two for the flower. The bird has more.": "/audio/33456da2a6a9a17e31276a3e.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Flower. Count both rows. Three is more than two.": "/audio/d85ecfab48a1e647fdec028e.mp3",
    "text:You explored The Sticker Chart. Say the English sentence and show what it means.": "/audio/7605389f7d7d72b84020c63f.mp3",
    "text:You explored Plants Need Sunlight. Come back and test what you remember.": "/audio/adc53fdfb703b4a0ae8f70d1.mp3",
    "text:Both patches get the same care. Let several days pass, then uncover the grass.": "/audio/5b09834e7d4327666705c3be.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Grass in sunlight. Thank you for trying. The green grass had sunlight. The covered grass became pale over several days.": "/audio/bd745a5db1352d0127b49e10.mp3",
    "text:Warming, rising vapour, cooling cloud drops, then rain.": "/audio/6de7f922145e7e8c5d2f5697.mp3",
    "text:The answer is The Sun. Thank you for trying. Look at the sunlight warming the river.": "/audio/e4350c3108e6d786939534b3.mp3",
    "text:Explore how water travels. Follow our model step by step.": "/audio/3e78164884a79db4b22dbf54.mp3",
    "text:Tap a body helper to find its job.": "/audio/19e3dbc108669245b3713c96.mp3",
    "text:Put the water-cycle stages in order.": "/audio/70d78cc6bad3f188b713ad15.mp3",
    "text:You explored Where Does Rain Come From?. Come back and test what you remember.": "/audio/065d90b9db41573743b6a0ba.mp3",
    "text:The brain helps us think and move.": "/audio/1a4f4782a89c77980244ef9f.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Rain. Thank you for trying. The tiny cloud drops join into larger drops that fall as rain.": "/audio/c73aafc83acbe1175f458ef6.mp3",
    "text:Which helper helps us think and move?": "/audio/f2bc2ca4b544ce19b216e139.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Lungs. Thank you for trying. Find the two blue lungs in the chest. They help us breathe.": "/audio/ec80c5a64ba1d382db525834.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Ears. Thank you for trying. The bell makes a sound. Our ears help us hear it.": "/audio/c2666ea244a01d1e4b953d4d.mp3",
    "text:The answer is brain. The brain helps us think and move.": "/audio/6c14ec31438bc0ba7d187908.mp3",
    "text:Explore with our senses.": "/audio/d74c561a67935a89767c3921.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Heart. Thank you for trying. The heart is the pump. It moves blood around the body.": "/audio/16c01e840e2b5f543214f124.mp3",
    "text:You explored Our Body Helpers. Come back and test what you remember.": "/audio/0eeb5398bdcd4548732b1def.mp3",
    "text:Which body part helps us hear?": "/audio/94cebfbf504cd2f666b3f3ff.mp3",
    "text:The answer is ears. We hear with our ears.": "/audio/7e8fe21390dd489bccd097a7.mp3",
    "text:Which body part helps us smell?": "/audio/3c0b5ea35195d2d8ec84d500.mp3",
    "text:The answer is nose. We smell with our nose.": "/audio/47e56e7091f25e9462161d0b.mp3",
    "text:Which body part helps us taste?": "/audio/58594fc3adf0c84a9df834b5.mp3",
    "text:We touch with our skin.": "/audio/e448d76d5a5d1263d384f864.mp3",
    "text:The answer is tongue. We taste with our tongue.": "/audio/71c6410faeddecc6002db5ac.mp3",
    "text:Which body part helps us touch?": "/audio/ee59d63237d6ca3420fcdbcb.mp3",
    "text:Match these animals to places shown in this story.": "/audio/4495573c8a8a20a981b131bc.mp3",
    "text:You explored Our Five Senses. Come back and test what you remember.": "/audio/c84418e94c931b47e1580854.mp3",
    "text:The answer is skin. We touch with our skin.": "/audio/1484acd26d1e0d97d137e001.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Tongue. Thank you for trying. The tongue helps us taste the apple. The nose helps us smell.": "/audio/88964ae22ddd6c68dfc1bf6b.mp3",
    "text:Turn Earth. Watch our marked place move into night.": "/audio/6b39913ecf4ba8872a85d0a2.mp3",
    "text:The answer is Farm. Thank you for trying. Remember the cow near the barn. We showed a farm.": "/audio/dd451ef073a059c288ead422.mp3",
